@startuml
title Usage Rating 2/2

participant "Event Management" as Event #grey
participant "Product Inventory" as PI
participant "Product Catalog" as PC
participant "Bill Calculation Management" as BCM

group loop

    Event -> BCM : 18. **TMF688 Event Management:**\npost /listener/ProductUsageStateChangeEvent\n(eventId,ProductUsageId=Id1\nProductUsage.Status="rated"\nUsageProductPrice.price.dutyFreeAmount.Money.value=1\nUsageProductPrice.price.dutyFreeAmount.Money.unit="EUR")
    BCM --> Event : 19. 200 OK

    BCM -> PI : 20. **TMF637 Product Inventory Management:**\nget /product/(ProductId.Id1)\n?(ProductOfferingId)
    activate PI
    PI --> BCM : 21. 200 OK (ProductOfferingId=Id1)

    BCM -> PI : 22. **TMF637 Product Inventory Management:**\nget /product/ (ProductId.Id1, ProductOfferingId.Id1)\n?(BillingAccountId, productSpecificationId)
    PI --> BCM : 23. 200 OK\n(BillingAccountId=Id7, productSpecificationId=Id1)
    deactivate PI

    BCM -> PC : 24. **TMF620 Product Catalog Management:**\nget UsageProdOfferPriceCharge\n(ProductUsageSpecId.Id1, productSpecificationId.Id1)\n?(UsageProdOfferPriceChargeId,\nUsageProdOfferPriceChargeValue,TaxProductOfferPriceAlterateration)
    activate PC
    PC --> BCM : 25. (UsageProductPriceChargeId1,\nUsageProdOfferPriceCharge.value=0,1euro/min, TaxProductOfferPriceAlterateration=20%)
    deactivate PC

    BCM -> BCM : 26. **TMF678 Customer Bill Mgt:**\nPost AppliedCustomerBillingProductUsageRate (UsageProdOfferPriceCharge(Value),\nProductId1, BillingAcountId.Id7, BillingPeriod)\n ==> AppliedCustomerBillingProductUsageRateId.Id1
    note right of BCM
      The Current version of
      the TMF678 does not
      expose the resource
      AppliedCustomerBillingProductUsageRate
    end note

    BCM -> BCM : 27. **TMF678 Customer Bill Mgt:**\nPatch /AppliedCustomerBillingProductUsageRate\n/AppliedCustomerBillingProductUsageRateId.Id1 (TaxProductOfferPriceAlterateration(value))
    note right of BCM
      (26,27)This operation  will be performed for all
      UsageProdPriceCharge generated and published through events.
      In this diagram, we illustrate the example of 'Voice National'.
    end note

end

@enduml
